WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.854
Five Questions That Keep You in Charge. The question is

2
00:00:04.854 --> 00:00:09.707
not whether an AI tool is impressive. The question is

3
00:00:09.707 --> 00:00:14.561
whether you can still explain what it is allowed to

4
00:00:14.561 --> 00:00:19.414
do, what it is not allowed to do, and who

5
00:00:19.414 --> 00:00:24.268
is accountable when it gets something wrong. Before a workflow

6
00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:29.121
moves from experiment to routine, ask five questions: What is

7
00:00:29.121 --> 00:00:33.975
the bounded job? What evidence is required? What may the

8
00:00:33.975 --> 00:00:38.828
system read or write? How do we stop it? Who

9
00:00:38.828 --> 00:00:43.682
gives the final approval? 1. Is the job narrow enough

10
00:00:43.682 --> 00:00:48.536
to inspect?. A useful workflow has a specific input, a

11
00:00:48.536 --> 00:00:53.389
specific output, and explicit non-goals. “Help with research” is not

12
00:00:53.389 --> 00:00:58.243
a job. “Compare three named sources and flag unsupported claims”

13
00:00:58.243 --> 00:01:03.096
is. 2. What evidence must travel with the output?. Claims

14
00:01:03.096 --> 00:01:07.950
should keep their sources, dates, and limitations. If a summary

15
00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:12.803
cannot show where it came from, it is a draft—not

16
00:01:12.803 --> 00:01:17.657
a decision. 3. What authority is actually granted?. Default to

17
00:01:17.657 --> 00:01:22.510
read-only access. Separate drafting from publication and recommendation from execution.

18
00:01:22.510 --> 00:01:27.364
4. Can the workflow be stopped cleanly?. Every recurring process

19
00:01:27.364 --> 00:01:32.218
needs a clear halt, a retained record, and a human

20
00:01:32.218 --> 00:01:37.071
review before restart. 5. Whose name is on the final

21
00:01:37.071 --> 00:01:41.925
call?. AI can assist the work. A person owns the

22
00:01:41.925 --> 00:01:46.778
judgment. That is not a limitation; it is the reason

23
00:01:46.778 --> 00:01:51.632
a system remains trustworthy. Use the full Five Questions field

24
00:01:51.632 --> 00:01:56.485
note as a review sheet before you give any workflow

25
00:01:56.485 --> 00:01:57.456
more responsibility.
